{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "task-api-collection",
		"name": "Task API",
		"description": "异步任务处理接口，支持翻译和摘要等 AI 任务类型。\n\nBase URL: /ai-api/v1\n\n鉴权：所有接口需要 Bearer Token，请在集合变量 bearer_token 中填入 token 值（对应 Apollo 配置 task_api.bearer_token）。\n\n使用方式：\n1. 在集合变量中设置 bearer_token\n2. 调用「创建任务」接口获取 task_id\n3. 用「获取任务」接口轮询状态，直到 status=4 (FINISH) 或 status=5 (ERROR)\n4. 批量查询可使用「批量获取任务」接口",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{bearer_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "bearer_token",
			"value": "YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "Bearer Token（对应 Apollo 配置 task_api.bearer_token，请勿提交真实 token）"
		},
		{
			"key": "task_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "翻译任务",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "创建翻译任务 - 单语言",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('task_id', jsonData.task_id);",
									"    pm.test('返回 task_id', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.task_id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
									"    });",
									"    pm.test('status 为 INIT(0)', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql(0);",
									"    });",
									"    pm.test('返回 created_at', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.created_at).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"task_type\": 1,\n  \"model\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\",\n  \"user_group\": \"marketing\",\n  \"translation_params\": {\n    \"source_language\": \"en-US\",\n    \"target_languages\": [\"zh-CN\"],\n    \"content\": \"Hello, world! This is a test message for translation.\"\n  }\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/ai-api/v1/task",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["ai-api", "v1", "task"]
						},
						"description": "创建单语言翻译任务（en-US → zh-CN）。\n\n创建成功后 task_id 会自动保存到集合变量，可直接用于后续查询。"
					},
					"response": []
				},
